// Every vector instantiation in td_api.tl. Both parsers materialise a vector as a List<T>, and a
// List<T> boxed into a WinRT object - which is what ItemsSource is - needs a CCW vtable for that
// exact instantiation. No analyzer can catch these: a binding assigns through the declared
// IList<T>, so the concrete type only exists at runtime.
//
// Real source rather than generated, because CsWinRT's own generator reads these attributes and a
// generator cannot see what another generator wrote. TDAPI003 reports anything missing after a
// schema update, and names the line to paste.

